              highlighted: ["angFCD","angCDF"] },
            { text: "so that the side {FC} also equals the side {FD}.",
              visible: HALF,
              highlighted: ["CF","DF","angFCD","angCDF"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "sides opposite equal angles are equal", ref: "I.6" }] },
            { text: "Similarly it can be proved that each of the straight lines {FB}, {FA}, and {FE}",
